config IREE
	bool "IREE"
	default n
	---help---
		IREE (Intermediate Representation Execution Environment, pronounced as "eerie")
		is an MLIR-based end-to-end compiler and runtime that lowers Machine Learning
		(ML) models to a unified IR that scales up to meet the needs of the datacenter
		and down to satisfy the constraints and special considerations of mobile and
		edge deployments.
